# /<app>/_next/static/* in images mode (compose.yml alone): the app's own server
# has the files, so the /<app>/* route proxies them like any other path. It proxies
# the public/ files Caddyfile.static.releases serves in follow mode; their cache
# headers come from the app's next.config.js.
#
#   import Caddyfile.static.next <app>
